---
const experiences = [
  {
    title: "Computación e Informática (3 ciclos)",
    institution: "Cibertec",
    date: "09/2024 - 08/2025",
  },
  {
    title: "Bootcamp Full-Stack Software Development",
    institution: "4Geeks Academy",
    date: "03/2025 - 06/2025",
  },
  {
    title: "Curso Figma and No-Code",
    institution: "Codigo by Tecsup",
    date: "09/2025 - 10/2025",
  },
  {
    title: "Ingeniería de Software",
    institution: "UTP",
    date: " Inicio: 03/2026",
  },
];
---

<section class="space-y-4 md:space-y-8">
  <div class="space-y-2 md:space-y-6">
    <h2>Education</h2>
    <p>
      Actualmente me encuentro estudiando de forma autodidacta, reforzando y
      ampliando los conocimientos que he adquirido durante mi formación
      académica, la cual es la siguiente:
    </p>
  </div>

  <ol
    class="relative space-y-8 before:absolute before:-ml-px before:h-full before:w-0.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-text"
  >
    {
      experiences.map((exp) => (
        <li class=" relative -ms-1.5 flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="size-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary" />

          <div class="-mt-2">
            <time class="text-xs/none font-medium text-text/90">
              {exp.date}
            </time>

            <h3 class="md:text-lg font-bold text-text drop-shadow-lg drop-shadow-black/40">
              {exp.title}
            </h3>

            <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-text/90">{exp.institution}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>
</section>
